@startuml
title Architecture 4: Concurrency & Atomicity Controller
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1F4E79
}

actor "Ride Owner" as RO
actor "Rider A" as RA
actor "Rider B" as RB

package "Concurrency & Synchronization Layer" {
  rectangle "Join Service" as JoinSvc
  rectangle "Concurrency Controller\n(Row-Level Lock Manager)" as LockMgr
}

database "Platform Repository\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB {
    rectangle "Ride Table"
    rectangle "JoinRequest Table"
}

RA --> JoinSvc : Submit Join Request
RB --> JoinSvc : Submit Join Request
JoinSvc --> DB : Insert Pending Requests + Snapshot

RO --> JoinSvc : Accept Rider A
JoinSvc --> LockMgr : Initiate Atomic Transaction

LockMgr --> DB : 1. SELECT FOR UPDATE (Lock Ride Row)
LockMgr --> DB : 2. Validate Seats > 0, Request = Pending

' Corrected Boundary: Includes conflicting request withdrawal
LockMgr --> DB : [Validation Passed] 3a. Decrement Seats,\nUpdate Status, Recalculate Fares,\nWithdraw Conflicting Requests (FR-RD-06.8), COMMIT
LockMgr --> DB : [Validation Failed] 3b. ROLLBACK (e.g. Seats = 0)

JoinSvc --> RA : Notify Acceptance
JoinSvc --> RB : Notify Drift / Needs Reconfirmation (If affected)
@enduml